Exact-context execution checks: 64 complete, 12 outside interpreter support,
12 reach the 20-second limit. The default evo wrapper also retains its header,
dialect and execution limits separately. Initial wrapper usage errors are not
source checks. None of these limits is reported as an interpreter PASS or UB.
Final combined acceptance: 451 suites, 3436 PASS, zero failures and eight
retained ignores; Clippy and formatting pass. All six Lean gate steps pass.
